stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Waiting
  Waiting --> Exploring
  Exploring --> Drawing
  Drawing --> HelpRequested: optional
  HelpRequested --> Drawing: continue
  Drawing --> Reviewing
  Reviewing --> Ready
  Ready --> Presenting
  Presenting --> OffScreen
  OffScreen --> Finished
  Exploring --> Finished: teacher ends early
  Drawing --> Finished: draft saved
  note right of Ready: Group progress is independent; another ready group does not advance the class.
